## Title: Writ Ready
## Author: @Dicen95728
## Version: 3.20
## AddOnVersion: 2
## APIVersion: 101050
## SavedVariables: WritReadySV
## DependsOn: LibCharacterKnowledge
## OptionalDependsOn: LibAddonMenu-2.0
## Description: Checks unconsumed Smithing/Clothier/Woodworking/Jewelry Master Writs in your inventory and tells you if you can craft them right now - trait AND style checked. /writready = inventory, /writready bank = + bank, then type /writready trader to check them.
WritReady.lua

# Self-contained: does not require the WritWorthy addon (not available on
# console). Writ-decoding and research-line data adapted from publicly
# documented ESO crafting structure and WritWorthy's open-source project
# (github.com/ziggr/ESO-WritWorthy) for interoperability - not copied
# verbatim, and used to reimplement equivalent logic independently.
